    "body": "Another potential usecase: postmessage not returning a promise is a pain-point when a page opens a different page (an iframe, a popup or a redirect) that needs to return its result back to the calling page, use cases include location picker, contact picker, payment form, social sign-in etc.\r\n\r\n@dvoytenko - author of https://github.com/google/web-activities\r\n\r\n",
