    "created_at": "2018-02-06T22:54:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-06T22:54:12Z",
    "body": "For all of these use cases, it's not clear to me what the returned promise would actually represent/when it would resolve and/or reject? I.e. what \"should\" postMessage actually return for any of this?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
