    "created_at": "2018-02-07T00:16:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-07T00:16:41Z",
    "body": "The window still spinning up case might be tricky perf wise since we don't queue the messages up today. Maybe we could get away with changing that, but for the folks that are polling, it will incur some (hopefully minor) overhead in the short-term.",
