    "created_at": "2018-02-07T00:54:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-07T00:54:46Z",
    "body": "For the ad network case, wouldn't it make more sense to fix load/error events?\r\n\r\nFor the service worker case, what does this really buy you if the target window is closed moments after the postMessage is received.  It seems what you really want is some way to know when the client goes away.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if that information can be safely exposed or not.  If not, though, I wonder if it's also not safe to expose it via a postMessage promise reaction.",
