    "updated_at": "2023-05-29T10:57:34Z",
    "body": "Coming from https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9340, it would seem that such a Promise based `postMessage()` should reject on unmatched `targetOrigin`, but this would expose the origin of the embedder, which might be pretty bad.",
